    "text": "<p>Different possible thermal decomposition pathways for peroxyesters are shown below. Match each<br >\r\n\r\npathway from List I with an appropriate structure from List II and select the correct answer using the code<br >\r\n\r\ngiven below the lists.<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image26-192d6dfb-e615-477e-8c89-e1b8fc86dfde.jpg\"/><br/>\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n</p><table border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td> </td><td>List – I</td><td> </td><td>List – II</td></tr><tr><td>A</td><td>Pathway P</td><td>P.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image27-cae9373e-82fd-4045-9de3-271eeb5dd604.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>B.</td><td>Pathway Q</td><td>Q.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image28-a27e749a-6051-4e20-9abe-745bcbccee07.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>C.</td><td>Pathway R</td><td>R.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image29-3c99672b-24fc-4ffd-8f0b-ad1c27e43f5b.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>D.</td><td>Pathway S</td><td>S.</td><td><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image30-80827316-b739-4f71-8719-9b71884f14d6.jpg\"/></td></tr></tbody></table>",
